### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- name: sports-arbitrage-scanner
-   Scans sports odds across multiple bookmakers to detect arbitrage opportunities —
-   situations where two or more bookmakers offer contradictory odds on the same match,
-   allowing a guaranteed profit regardless of outcome. Uses The Odds API (free tier)
-   with automatic fallback to sample demo data when no API key is provided. For each
-   match, the skill computes implied probabilities, detects when their sum is below 1
-   (arb condition), calculates the exact optimal stake split across outcomes, and
-   reports the profit percentage. Only opportunities above 0.5% profit are surfaced.
-   Results are logged to stdout and saved to /tmp/sports_arb_results.json for downstream
-   agent consumption. Runs every 30 minutes via cron.
-   version: 1.0.0
+ name: polymarket-sports-arbitrage
